":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p037","text":"三年，東陽太守殷仲文與永嘉太守駱球謀反，欲建桓胤為嗣，曹靖之、桓石鬆、卞承之、劉延祖等潛相交結，劉裕以次收斬之，並誅其家屬。後桓謙走入蜀，蜀賊譙縱以謙為荊州刺史，使率兵而下，荊楚之眾多應之。謙至枝江，荊州刺史劉道規斬之，梁州刺史傅歆又斬桓石綏，桓氏遂滅。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2644703-raw.wikitext","raw_start":10288,"raw_end":10417,"character_positions":[10290,10291,10292,10293,10294,10295,10296,10297,10298,10299,10300,10301,10302,10303,10304,10305,10306,10307,10308,10309,10310,10311,10312,10313,10314,10315,10316,10317,10318,10319,10320,10321,10322,10323,10324,10325,10326,10327,10328,10329,10330,10331,10332,10333,10334,10335,10336,10337,10338,10339,10340,10341,10342,10343,10344,10345,10346,10347,10348,10349,10350,10351,10352,10353,10354,10355,10356,10357,10358,10359,10360,10361,10362,10363,10364,10365,10366,10367,10368,10369,10370,10371,10372,10373,10374,10375,10376,10377,10378,10379,10380,10381,10382,10383,10384,10385,10386,10387,10388,10389,10390,10391,10392,10393,10394,10395,10396,10397,10398,10399,10400,10401,10402,10403,10404,10405,10406,10407,10408,10409,10410,10411,10412,10413,10414,10415,10416]},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p037:m0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"殷仲文","kind":"person","person_id":"jel_xae_qmj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p037:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"駱球","kind":"person","person_id":"c6b_aem_lfz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p037:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"桓胤","kind":"person","person_id":"624_801_009","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p037:m0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"曹靖之","kind":"person","person_id":"rks_79h_r12","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p037:m0031","start":31,"end":34,